Output out/hero.gif
Set Shell bash
Set Width 1180
Set Height 620
Set FontSize 16
Set Padding 12
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "cd $SPECGETTY_DEMO/projects/harbour-app"
Enter
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "spg --config $SPECGETTY_DEMO/config.yml"
Enter
Sleep 1800ms
Type "2"
Sleep 1200ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 1400ms
Down
Sleep 1800ms
Down
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 2200ms
Type "q"
Sleep 400ms
